  "plain": "In January 1996, in Varginha, a town in Brazil where people say a strange craft came down and creatures were captured, a farmer living near the site reportedly said his whole house shook at 5 a.m. and soldiers told his family to stay inside. A man named Carlos Dosoza relays this from film recordings made by Claudia Kovu. If true, it would point to a real crash and a military operation that morning."
